<title>USA: NOTICE OF SALE - Gloucester, N.J..</title>
<headline>NOTICE OF SALE - Gloucester, N.J..</headline>
<text>
<p>NOTICE OF CORRECTION</p>
<p>				  $8,880,000</p>
<p>		     THE BOARD OF EDUCATION OF THE</p>
<p>		   TOWNSHIP OF WEST DEPTFORD IN THE</p>
<p>		   COUNTY OF GLOUCESTER, NEW JERSEY</p>
<p>			     SCHOOL BOND SALE</p>
<p>The principal payment of the Bonds will be January 1. The interest payment dates will be each January 1 and July 1, beginning July 1, 1998.</p>
<p>			  (From The Bond Buyer)</p>
</text>
